Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Auntie Stella and\Nthe construction guys are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, looks like the guild made\Nit through without much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've\Ntaken a good look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't learn one decent skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent a full three-month term\Npracticing at every training school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you didn't pass one? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, I'm sorry. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let you\Nregister as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was really fun to be reunited with my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instructors from back in\Nmy first training days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw them\Nwas like 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a light that's bright and bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to do the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.01,0:01:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in love with me,\NI'm not to do the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to give up with my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not to give up with my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.81,0:01:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you find?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Clays Royal Capital - 15 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to train as a swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Train with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have a permit\Nfrom the Adventurer's Guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got one from the Guildmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.19,0:03:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The training is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to\Nfinish no matter how hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be even more intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.97,0:03:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will be lucky to last three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is day 10 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, the kid has a tenacity\Nthat is definitely nothing to scarlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not drop your sword no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy will not wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe his eyes\Nare still so full of vigor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after being put\Nthrough such a brutal test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the kid might actually\Nhave a promising future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When do you think I'll be able\Nto start learning a real skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not something I decide for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.93,0:04:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And can you at least show me what kind\Nof skill I might be able to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was that, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I couldn't see most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:04:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a swift foot technique that\Nis even difficult for me to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boy like this probably\Ncouldn't see much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kept the same rhythm the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were steady like a clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.79,0:05:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ba! Ba! Ba-ba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such latent potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nurtured properly, he could match me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or surpass me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.23,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(83.2,97.2)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.23,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why has he not been able to\Nlearn a skill aside from Perry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he needs is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one skill that could\Nbe considered useful.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.56,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(83.2,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.56,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Noor.\NUh-huh. Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, just give me a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going further would\Nonly be a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A parry isn't enough for someone\Nto make it as a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsmanship is something he simply\Ndoesn't have the aptitude for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be wiser if\Nyou were to choose another path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your talent may be found\Nin another capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be another path\Nfor this child. Whoa. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really you're serious about\Ntaking part in my training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,camp the swordsman instructor\Ntold me to try something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else sig sent you huh i\Nhad heard he was looking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after a little kid but uh\Nhe looks small enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get blown away by a light\Nbreeze i would have been
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adventurer no matter what a\Nwarrior's role is to become
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shield for their allies.\NYou understand that, mm-hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay, then let's do it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,216.0)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give the boy credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought he'd get this far
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, talk about being tough and gutsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he could just acquire a skill, I\Ncould train this kid to be invincible.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.40,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(454.4,216.0)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.40,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(448.0,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what you have acquired is only a slight\Nimprovement of your natural abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Force yourself to continue, you\Nmay very well lose your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you'll have to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He toughed it out more than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves to be where\Nhis efforts are rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to train here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want to do this, kid? I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.61,0:07:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit that stick hanging over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:07:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once he misses, I\Ncan tell him to get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already tell he's going\Nto be a huge pain in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, was that one good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want nothing to do\Nwith this little twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, why am I doing nothing\Nbut throwing rocks at stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I just know you're going\Nto be too much trouble, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to use a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, get a good grip on it and\Nstand in position. A good grip, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble, trouble, trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.55,0:08:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the last of my training bows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't break mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.49,0:09:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bow can handle even the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stick to throwing stones, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,216.0)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(64.0,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.81,0:09:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who taught you to throw like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just how I've always hunted birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The super colorful ones that\Nswoop down and grab rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a thunder flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's difficult for even the most seasoned\Nhunter to bring those things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I could totally\Ndo it with my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in him being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't learned anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, you lack the prudence to\Nhandle any sort of delicate weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good with rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.77,0:09:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be a waste of everyone's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the kid\NI've been hearing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? Huh? You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will start right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sense the enemy's presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sneak up on them without\Nmaking a sound in your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are various traps\Nrigged along the corridor.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.15,Song,,0,0,0,,{\an8\an8\blur0.5\fs17}There are various traps\Nrigged along this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoid setting off any of the traps and\Nmake your way to this treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoid all the traps, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although he...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he is missing the point of the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed to dismantle the traps and\Nyour situational awareness is abysmal.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.65,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.65,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.15,0:11:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no hope of becoming a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, this boy has tenacity\Nthat is beyond comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A valuable quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he ever gives up on\Nbecoming an adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will extend an invitation to\Njoin the Royal Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh you're quite young to be\Napplying for this aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure there's an age\Nrequirement of at least 15 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already got a permit\Nfrom the guild master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trained at a bunch\Nof the other schools too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.79,0:12:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(454.4,129.6)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(448.0,154.8)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you struggle to is because
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no mono flowing\Nthrough you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it not flow through me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps you were just born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only hope of changing that is to\Ngo inside the mono-resonance room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rizzo... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.63,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But leave immediately if it starts\Nfeeling too intense for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boy hasn't come outside yet? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, that is not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That room drastically amplifies\Nall of the human senses,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's been in there for days!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could kill him if we're not careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your body feel all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:12:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm about to have a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all I've learned to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think you've come this far, yet\Nall you can manage is tiny flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's extremely rare to see someone as\Nincapable of magic as you seem to be, Gnor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look, given your lack of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's actually impressive\Nhow far you've come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.11,0:13:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dual casting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me 50 years to get to that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet he managed it on his\Nown in just three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't help me be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.39,0:13:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out this isn't the right\Nplace for you either, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid has so much talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only his body were\Nmore attuned to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.81,0:14:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have been known throughout\Nthe land as an unparalleled magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you undergo the rite of blessing\Nwhen you were a small child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rite of blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this school, only those who were selected\Nin advance and underwent the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you\Nagree to let me train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you\Nagree to let me train with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot seriously intend\Nto stay there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to participate\Nin the basics of our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although please,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand that there is no guarantee\Nyou will actually acquire a skill.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.60,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.60,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is most certainly Low Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how on earth is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low Heel won't be\Nrecognized as a serviceable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.01,0:16:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skill to make you an\Naccredited adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it only works on scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's still impressive you\Ncan use low-level healing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic without a natural blessing\Nalready bestowed on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He performed a miracle all on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without undergoing the rite or\Nusing a spirit as an intermediary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which, in a manner of speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,means he can wield the power\Nof miracles without limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Sane, about Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared from the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have stopped him\Nwhile I still had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just leave him be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's strong enough\Nto hack it all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we help in nurturing his gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he will undoubtedly become\Nsomeone quite extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:17:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was going\Nthrough the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At all, the other schools,\Ntoo, we should all give.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him guidance and the\Ntraining that he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That young man is overflowing\Nwith such promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it means I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recruit him to the intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am of the same opinion\Nas saying I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading off on a search\Nto find him now. Hey. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand your eagerness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just to be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six we will all raise the boy as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all agree. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.41,0:17:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then let's go find this\Nyoung prodigy right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looky here. Nor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:17:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe. Yeah. I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow found this\Nlying on the ground. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have flown off in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So. Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose you're.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well on your way to Mithra already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, you saw what was\Nhappening and came back. Sorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the news and turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all caked in mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your clothes are burnt up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a hectic day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kinda got into some stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a pretty bad time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody here is in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.13,0:18:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I am worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to do this to you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.05,0:18:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially since you're all beat to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the foreman was looking\Nall over the place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs you to haul away some rubble\Nand help build some temporary housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I came by, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a map. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you back is a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're here, our\Nprogress is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I can still be of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew, man, what a crazy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went on a ride in a\Ncarriage, met a demon folk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to fly with Lin's amazing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I got to fly\Nagain by Lin's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some other stuff happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but flying around all over\Nthe place is what I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need something to eat and get\Nsome rest soon, but no time for that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already figured it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the theocracy of Mithra\Nwere the ones working
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,behind the scenes with\NDoritas on waging this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:19:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the Minotaur incident\Nto The Empire's weaponry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the high purity monostones which\Ncan only be produced in Mithra have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a factor at every turn. I fear\Nour future will not be peaceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However there are people\Nour nation can depend on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.37,0:20:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we are blessed to have a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.51,0:20:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, thank you so much\Nfor everything you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real hero, you know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was hard for you, but you're\Nstill here handing out supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also been treating\Nthose who are injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're helping with\Nthe restoration, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you are in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm handing these out to\Neverybody, so please help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By all means, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get back to it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you soon! Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, Lynn. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't work yourself too hard, instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I wouldn't be where I am\Nwithout so many people's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move so much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really is a good, sturdy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.51,0:21:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it won't see very much\Nflashy action with me holding on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe one day I'll finally
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get to be an adventurer and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.81,0:22:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can have epic journeys like\Nthe heroes in the storybooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.81,0:22:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones like Dad read to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.11,0:22:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the time being, I'll\Nput you to good use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we've cleared out enough in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.01,0:22:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you good to keep working elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure. No problem. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.35,0:22:33.35,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#12 I Parry Everything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I guess this is\Nwhere we really belong anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:23:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.03,0:23:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.

